### GET /
{"message":"Welcome to Student Management API"}

### GET /docs (Swagger UI - HTTP status)
HTTP 200

### POST /students?student_id=101
{"message":"Student created successfully","student_id":101,"student":{"name":"Rahul","age":20,"course":"Computer Science","email":"rahul@example.com"}}

### POST again (duplicate -> HTTP 400)
HTTP 400

### GET /students
{"students":{"101":{"name":"Rahul","age":20,"course":"Computer Science","email":"rahul@example.com"}}}

### GET /students/101
{"name":"Rahul","age":20,"course":"Computer Science","email":"rahul@example.com"}

### PUT /students/101
{"message":"Student completely updated","student_id":101,"student":{"name":"Rahul Kumar","age":21,"course":"Artificial Intelligence","email":"rahulkumar@example.com"}}

### PATCH /students/101 (only course)
{"message":"Student partially updated","student_id":101,"student":{"name":"Rahul Kumar","age":21,"course":"Data Science","email":"rahulkumar@example.com"}}

### GET /students/999 (missing -> HTTP 404 detail)
HTTP 404 
{"detail":"Student not found"}

### POST invalid age -> HTTP 422
HTTP 422

### POST invalid email -> HTTP 422
HTTP 422

### DELETE /students/101
{"message":"Student deleted successfully","student_id":101,"student":{"name":"Rahul Kumar","age":21,"course":"Data Science","email":"rahulkumar@example.com"}}

### GET /students/101 after delete (HTTP 404)
HTTP 404 
{"detail":"Student not found"}
